sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (off-days manager pada detail jadwal/worker)"
    participant C as WorkerOffDayController
    participant Svc as WorkerOffDayService
    participant W as "Worker Model"
    participant WOD as "WorkerOffDay Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form tambah hari libur (single/recurring)
    View->>C: POST /admin/workers/{workerId}/off-days/patterns

    C->>C: Validasi input (type, date/day_of_week, periode, reason)
    C->>W: Validasi worker tersedia
    W->>DB: SELECT workers WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>W: Data worker / null

    alt Data valid
        C->>WOD: Simpan aturan hari libur
        WOD->>DB: INSERT INTO worker_off_days (...)
        C-->>View: JSON success + data pola
        View-->>Admin: Daftar hari libur bertambah
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: JSON error validasi/proses
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan pesan gagal simpan
    end
